{
  "slug": "career-brand",
  "name": "Career Brand",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered personal branding and career strategy for LinkedIn. Two skills that work together:\n\n/brand — Scans your LinkedIn profile, learns your story, and helps you write posts that sound like you (not like AI). Creates monthly content calendars,\nbrainstorms ideas from your recent work, and offers hook variations to choose from. Supports any language.\n\n/career — Career co-pilot that considers your full picture: job search, side projects, and unique background. Evaluates job offers, optimizes your\nLinkedIn profile, builds networking strategies, and preps you for interviews with stories from your real experience.\n\nIncludes a career-advisor agent that ensures your content strategy aligns with your career goals. Works for engineers, product managers, founders, career\nchangers, and anyone who deserves to be visible for the work they do.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 agent**, **2 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `brand` (Personal branding & LinkedIn content), `career` (Career co-pilot)\n- **Agents** (1): `career-advisor` (Strategic advisor for career decisions, content themes, post risk checks, opportunity evaluation, and networking strategy)\n- **Commands** (2): `brand` (Create LinkedIn posts, plan content calendars, brainstorm ideas, or set post reminders), `career` (Career co-pilot — direction, job search, networking, interview prep)\n- **Hooks** (1): `Notification`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install career-brand@claude-community` from `asaferdman23/career-brand-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 2
  },
